# dynatrace_synthetic_v2_location (Resource)

-> **Dynatrace SaaS only**

-> This resource requires the OAuth scopes `synthetic:locations:read` and `synthetic:locations:write`

## Dynatrace Documentation


- Private Synthetic locations https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/observe/digital-experience/synthetic/synthetic-app/private-locations
- Synthetic API https://docs.dynatrace.com/docs/dynatrace-api/platform-api/platform-synthetic-v1

## Export Example Usage

- `terraform-provider-dynatrace -export dynatrace_synthetic_v2_location` downloads the currently configured private synthetic locations

The full documentation of the export feature is available [here](https://dt-url.net/h203qmc).

